      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, really nice imagery. I just ran it through the SEO checker and we're still sitting at a bit of a mediocre score for our standards. \n\nCould you try a second version? I want it to be even more \"descriptive.\" Don't worry about making the sentences too long, just really lean into those descriptors to push that adjective count way up. We really need to maximize that richness score to ensure it gets the homepage slot.",
